#. type: .abstract-title
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/_index.adoc:54
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Welcome to the Accessibility Handbook.  This book covers the assistive "
"technologies available in FreeBSD."
msgstr "欢迎阅读《无障碍手册》。本书介绍 FreeBSD 中可用的辅助技术。"

#. type: .abstract-title
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/_index.adoc:59
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Accessibility is an ongoing effort, not a fixed destination.  As such, this "
"handbook is a living document and continually evolving.  Contributions, "
"suggestions, and feedback are highly encouraged.  If you are interested in "
"contributing, please reach out to us via the https://lists.freebsd.org/"
"subscription/freebsd-accessibility[FreeBSD accessibility mailing list]."
msgstr "无障碍是一项持续进行的工作，而非固定的终点。因此，本手册是一份不断发展的文档。我们非常欢迎大家贡献内容、提出建议并提供反馈。如果您有兴趣参与贡献，请通过 link:https://lists.freebsd.org/subscription/freebsd-accessibility[FreeBSD 无障碍邮件列表]联系我们。"

#. type: .abstract-title
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/_index.adoc:61
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You can download this book in various formats and compression options from "
"the FreeBSD download server or one of its many mirror sites."
msgstr "您可以从 FreeBSD 下载服务器或其众多镜像站点之一下载本书，并选择不同的格式和压缩选项。"

